<https://hexplain.io/ns/aspect/fsmeta> skos:scopeNote "Use for logical file or directory metadata recorded by a container or filesystem representation; it need not describe the current host filesystem."@en .
afs:IntegerValueShape skos:definition "Applied through references from other shapes. An integer value is a literal of an XSD integer-family datatype (xsd:integer, xsd:positiveInteger, xsd:nonNegativeInteger, xsd:int, xsd:long, xsd:unsignedInt, xsd:unsignedLong, xsd:short, xsd:unsignedShort, xsd:byte or xsd:unsignedByte). A conforming value is an integer (of any XSD integer datatype)."@en .
afs:RangeDatatypeShape skos:definition "Applies to subjects using afs:creationTime, afs:fileName, afs:fileSize, afs:isDirectory, afs:modificationTime. afs:creationTime takes an xsd:dateTime literal (rdfs:range xsd:dateTime). afs:fileName takes an xsd:string literal (rdfs:range xsd:string). afs:fileSize takes an integer within the xsd:unsignedLong value space (rdfs:range xsd:unsignedLong). afs:isDirectory takes an xsd:boolean literal (rdfs:range xsd:boolean). afs:modificationTime takes an xsd:dateTime literal (rdfs:range xsd:dateTime)."@en .
afs:creationTime skos:definition "The source-reported time at which an entry was created; precision and timezone availability depend on the format."@en .
afs:fileName skos:definition "The name of a file or directory entry as recorded by its container or filesystem representation."@en .
afs:isDirectory skos:definition "Whether an entry denotes a directory rather than a regular file payload."@en .
afs:modificationTime skos:definition "The source-reported time at which an entry's content was last modified."@en .
